<glyph name="M" format="2">
  <advance width="958"/>
  <unicode hex="004D"/>
  <note>
Upright capital with lightly flared shoulders and a cupped, not needle-pointed, valley.
Weight master: 正文中粗：竖茎 108、横画 94，比 Regular 暗一档，但横画追得更快，对比下降。B 上碗开始收、下碗保持，腰轻收。M 谷加深而不是简单加粗。字距略紧。
</note>
